  "worked_solution": "We recall the graph of $y={e}^{3x}.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13943873/assets/bf852abc3bc3e365b652b0d1d9f99f21bb1f431cbe09f106740eee61cecab86e.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we see that the function increases without bound as $x$ increases. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }{e}^{3x}=\\infty .\n$$",
